        "70d1871c-3ddf-4a81-b77c-c0a30640e2a1": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 576,
            "width": 736,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## \u23f2\ufe0f Timing\n\nThe `Wait 1m` in the provoke lane must stay: the trigger records its polling window when the flow starts, and the comment has to be posted after that. The trigger polls, so allow a few minutes - the AfterAll timeout is 420s on purpose.\n\nThe flow opens its own issue in `apx-vero/appmixer-test`, deletes the comment the trigger reported and closes the issue, so it needs no pre-existing test data and is repeatable."
        }
